# Single-page app fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
# Without this, directly visiting or refreshing on any deep route
# (e.g. /app/online-store, /s/some-shop, /s/some-shop/products/xyz)
# can be served Cloudflare's default 404 instead of index.html — the
# React app (and its CSS/JS bundle) never even loads, which can look
# exactly like a broken/unstyled page.
#
# Cloudflare Pages Functions under /api/* already take priority over
# this file automatically and are unaffected by the catch-all below.
/*    /index.html   200
